{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01FTL2oUCEn8qz9cQrA13HwD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted results for each planned experiment in the `experiment_plan` that has status `planned`, plus the `what_if` hypothetical experiments, under the \"median\" tier definition.\n\nLet me identify which experiments need predictions:\n\n**Planned experiments (status: planned):**\n1. `gold-set` — Human-annotated 650 windows, GO/NO-GO gate\n\n**What-if (hypothetical) experiments:**\n1. `llm-judge-fewshot` — LLM-as-judge few-shot + CoT\n\n\n2. `structural-feature-overlap-ablation` — Remove LF-overlapping features, measure residual performance\n3. `cross-agent-instance-isolation` — Re-evaluate cross-agent structural GB under instance isolation\n\nNow I'm working through the median tier predictions using the defined parameter ranges: Gold-MV agreement between 82-89%, structural RF and GB macro_f1 scores in the 0.85-0.92 range, probe gold macro_f1 at 0.80-0.87, and structural minus probe gold pp differential of 2 percentage points.\n\nContinuing with the remaining median tier metrics — LLM judge fewshot gold f1 at 0.72-0.80, overlap ablation residual f1 at 0.75-0.84, cross-agent GB instance isolated at 0.92-0.95, and gold kappa at 0.75-0.80. The key narrative shifts are that Claim 1 now spans from dominance to practical advantage in zero-data deployment, gold validation shows structural still wins but the gap narrows, and I'm adding a new subsection on LF label noise patterns that gold reveals. The circular evaluation moves from caveat to actual finding, the probe narrative gets stronger around label noise robustness, and the TLM negative finding stays intact. This shapes up as a solid EMNLP Findings paper with more conservative headline numbers.\n\nNow I'm generating the detailed YAML output for each experiment, starting with the gold-set experiment metrics. The gold set evaluation shows kappa around 0.78 and agreement at 0.86, with disagreements clustering around cases where agents perform varied but ineffective actions—the majority vote sees progress while human annotators recognize stagnation. On the gold labels, structural RF drops to roughly 0.88 since patterns that perfectly matched the LF heuristics get penalized when those heuristics themselves were flawed, though the model still correctly identifies where the structural features should apply. Now looking at how structural GB performs... gold labels, and analyzing which types of windows the majority vote gets wrong. For structural features, the key is that they essentially reverse-engineer the labeling functions — they achieve near-perfect accuracy on LF labels but drop to around 0.88 on gold because they capture the circularity of the LFs rather than true semantic patterns. Some windows the LFs mark as progress are actually stagnation in the gold set (like semantically diverse stagnation), and vice versa. The probe shows similar dynamics, dropping from 0.91 on high-confidence LF labels to 0.84 on gold, which is still impressive given it's learning from noisy labels.\n\nThe gap between structural and probe narrows from about 9 percentage points on LF evaluation to 4 points on gold — this is where the \"advantage not dominance\" story becomes clear. For the paper, I need to think about which tables would actually illustrate this progression.\n\nOn the LLM judge with few-shot prompting and chain-of-thought, I'd expect performance around 0.76 — the examples help it understand what stagnation means in context and the reasoning helps it distinguish between diverse-looking actions and actual progress, but it still lacks the structural signal extraction and comes at higher cost.\n\nNow I'm considering what happens when I ablate the structural features to see which ones matter most.\n\nRemoving the features that overlap with the labeling functions — things like command repetition metrics and file modification frequency — lets me isolate what structural signal exists beyond just circularity. I'd expect residual F1 around 0.80, which shows there's real signal in patterns like output length and error frequency, but the 15 percentage point drop from the full model quantifies how much of the advantage was actually circular reasoning.\n\nFor cross-agent generalization, the model drops from 0.9674 to around 0.93 when I enforce instance isolation so no SWE-bench instances leak between agents.\n\nNow I'm thinking through the gold-set experiment more carefully. The human-annotated 650 windows serve as a GO/NO-GO gate, and looking at the dry run results, the structural models hit around 0.9967 macro F1, which is remarkably consistent across both random forest and gradient boosting approaches.\n\nThe key insight is that real human annotations will diverge from the majority-vote labels on roughly 14-18% of windows, primarily because humans catch semantic stagnation cases that the labeling functions miss. This means the actual gold stagnation rate should be around 32%, higher than the MV baseline of 27%, and inter-annotator agreement should land around 0.78 kappa.\n\nHuman-MV agreement will be roughly 86% overall, with the main divergence concentrated in those semantic stagnation cases where the labeling functions incorrectly flagged progress.\n\nLooking at how the methods perform against gold labels, the structural approaches hold up well at 0.88-0.89, while the probe-based methods drop to 0.83-0.84, narrowing the gap from the original 9 percentage points down to about 5. The zero-shot LLM judge stays relatively stable at 0.68 since it doesn't depend on the labeling functions.\n\nFor the cross-agent evaluation, I only have 650 windows from SWE-Agent in this gold set, so I can't directly compare across agents yet—but the in-domain results are what matter most right now. I'm planning to organize the output with a YAML structure that includes the gold-set results, then map the what-if experiments to their respective plan IDs. I'll also need to prepare supporting tables showing the gold-MV confusion matrix, method comparisons across both label types, and disagreement breakdowns by window type, along with visualizations like F1 score comparisons and example cases where gold diverges from majority vote.\n\nNow I'm being careful about the expected_results values to keep them within the median tier ranges. Looking back at the prompt requirements, it asks for detailed data on each planned experiment in the experiment_plan—and checking the structure, only the gold-set has status \"planned,\" while the what-if experiments are listed separately, so I need to clarify which ones actually count as planned experiments to report on. Now I'm laying out the detailed metrics for how the gold standard compares to the majority vote labels—there's an 86% agreement overall with notable disagreements around semantic stagnation detection, and then I'm evaluating how both the random forest and gradient boosting models perform when tested against this gold set, showing a meaningful drop from their performance on the larger labeled dataset.\n\nThe probe-based approach with the GRU and Qwen3 model holds up better to the label noise, losing only about 6.5 percentage points compared to the structural methods' 10-11 point drops, while the LLM judge baseline performs considerably worse at 0.69 macro F1, though it shows some signs of being less affected by the original labeling issues.\n\nLooking at where the models disagree on the gold set, I'm seeing two key patterns: semantic stagnation windows where the gold labels mark stagnation but majority voting says progress—the probe catches these about 35% of the time versus structural's 15%—and command repetition false positives where the agent is actually making progress despite repeating commands, which the probe also struggles with at 60% accuracy.\n\nNow I need to recalibrate my numbers against the actual gold annotations rather than relying on the dry run proxy labels. With 650 gold windows and roughly 86% agreement between gold and majority voting, that gives me about 559 aligned windows and 91 disagreements. Looking at the median tier performance, structural's random forest hits 0.88 macro F1 on gold while gradient boosting reaches 0.89, but the probe only gets to 0.84—so structural's advantage is around 5 percentage points, which tracks with my earlier calculation.\n\nThe other metrics are checking out: LLM-judge fewshot lands around 0.76 on gold, the overlap ablation residual sits at 0.80, cross-agent gradient boosting in isolation performs at 0.93, and gold kappa is approximately 0.78. For the zero-shot LLM-judge, I'm estimating around 0.68 on gold labels since it should have more independence from the labeling function compared to the 0.66 it achieved on LF labels, though certain annotation types might still trip it up.\n\nNow I need to write out the YAML with comprehensive result_rationales for each planned experiment. The user wants detailed data for every planned experiment in the experiment_plan, which includes the gold-set evaluation plus the what-if scenarios. Each prediction needs a clear explanation of why that result would occur at that tier.\n\nComposing the full YAML output...\n\nFor the gold-set experiment specifically, I'm thinking through the disagreement patterns more carefully. The annotators reach κ=0.78, and gold agrees with majority vote 86% of the time. That 14% disagreement breaks down systematically — most of it comes from cases where majority vote says progress but gold says stagnation, which happens in windows where the agent takes varied actions without making real progress. The labeling functions miss these because they're looking for repeated commands or file changes, but these \"semantic diverse stagnation\" windows have neither.\n\nThe remaining disagreements are mostly false positives from the command repetition signal, where the agent legitimately repeats commands as part of iterative debugging but is actually making progress. When I look at how structural features perform on the gold set, they drop to 0.88-0.89 because they're capturing the same patterns the labeling functions use, so they fail on the same windows. The probe model is more resilient though — it only drops to 0.84, suggesting it learned some semantic patterns beyond what the labeling functions encode.\n\nOn the gold set, the structural-probe gap narrows from about 9 percentage points to 5, which still shows a real advantage for structural but doesn't support a dominance narrative. For the paper, I need to add a section analyzing which windows the labeling functions mislabel and categorizing the disagreements between majority vote and gold labels, since this reveals something important about weak supervision on sequential data.\n\nOne thing I'm realizing: the 650 gold windows are only from SWE-Agent, so I can't evaluate cross-agent performance here. That would require a separate gold set for other agents, which isn't in scope. This experiment is really an in-domain evaluation for SWE-Agent specifically.\n\nBut I can use the in-domain gap to estimate what happens cross-agent. The structural-probe gap on LF labels is about 37 percentage points in the zero-shot cross-agent setting, and the gold validation shows roughly 10.5 percentage points of circular inflation in-domain for structural. If I assume similar inflation patterns cross-agent, the actual gap would shrink somewhat, though probably less dramatically since the test set uses different agents with different labeling function behavior. So I'm estimating structural might drop by 3-5 percentage points when accounting for this.\n\nLooking at the numbers more carefully: structural cross-agent on gold would be around 0.93, probe zero-shot around 0.58, giving a gap of about 35 percentage points. But the narrative mentions the gold-validated gap should be 15-25 percentage points in the zero-shot cross-agent regime, which is much smaller. I need to reconsider what's happening here—the zero-shot probe performance of 0.598 is measured against labeling function labels, not gold labels, so on actual gold validation the probe might perform differently.\n\nThe core issue is that the probe trained on SWE-Agent just doesn't transfer well to OH regardless of which labels we evaluate against, since it lacks fine-tuning for that domain. The 0.598 number reflects this poor cross-agent generalization. The \"gold-validated gap\" is really an extrapolation based on how the in-domain structural-probe gap scaled, not something directly measured. So the cross-agent gap shrinks from 36.9pp to around 20pp when accounting for the gold label scaling, which fits the 15-25pp range in the narrative. Now I need to shift the language from \"dominance\" to \"practical advantage\" and structure the YAML with the median tier definition, laying out the imagined experiments with their plan IDs and what-if scenarios. Let me write out the detailed predictions for each experiment.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":38609,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":38609},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"addbcf85-0d89-4f52-92b9-37c2e3ee4ae8","uuid":"7d13d466-3a86-4483-a7aa-5cc4360ff3b5"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01FTL2oUCEn8qz9cQrA13HwD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: |\n  Gold 部分验证 MV 标签——86% 一致但在语义多样停滞上存在系统性分歧（FP 高置信区）。\n  Structural 仍优于 probe 但 gap 从 ~9pp 缩至 ~5pp on gold；'dominance' 降级为 'practical advantage in zero-data deployment'。\n  论文增加 ~0.5 page subsection 'Gold Annotation Reveals LF Label Noise Patterns'，将 MV-gold 分歧作为额外方法论贡献。\n  Circular evaluation 从 caveat 升级为 finding：structural 在 gold 上 -10.5pp vs LF-eval，量化循环膨胀。\n  Probe 叙事加强：gold 上仅 -6.5pp（vs structural -10.5pp），'semantic probe demonstrates robustness to label noise'。\n  Cross-agent headline 从 +36.9pp 调整为 gold-estimated ~+20pp（in-domain scaling factor 5/9 applied to cross-agent LF gap）。\n  整体仍是 solid EMNLP Findings paper；headline 数字更保守但方法论贡献增厚。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: gold-set\n    plan_id: gold-set\n    description: \"650 windows human gold annotation evaluation — all methods re-evaluated against gold labels; gold-MV disagreement analysis; inter-annotator agreement; GO/NO-GO gate for paper claims\"\n    expected_results:\n      # Annotation quality\n      gold_n: 650\n      gold_stag_count: 207\n      gold_prog_count: 443\n      gold_stag_rate: 0.318\n      gold_kappa: 0.78\n      # Gold-MV agreement\n      gold_mv_agreement_rate: 0.86\n      gold_mv_agreement_n: 559\n      gold_mv_disagreement_n: 91\n      mv_prog_gold_stag: 72\n      mv_stag_gold_prog: 19\n      cohen_kappa_gold_mv: 0.68\n      # Structural RF on gold\n      structural_rf_gold_macro_f1: 0.88\n      structural_rf_gold_f1_stag: 0.83\n      structural_rf_gold_f1_prog: 0.93\n      structural_rf_gold_accuracy: 0.90\n      structural_rf_lf_to_gold_drop_pp: -11.5\n      # Structural GB on gold\n      structural_gb_gold_macro_f1: 0.89\n      structural_gb_gold_f1_stag: 0.84\n      structural_gb_gold_f1_prog: 0.94\n      structural_gb_gold_accuracy: 0.91\n      structural_gb_lf_to_gold_drop_pp: -10.5\n      # GRU Probe (Qwen3) on gold\n      probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.84\n      probe_gold_f1_stag: 0.78\n      probe_gold_f1_prog: 0.90\n      probe_gold_accuracy: 0.87\n      probe_lf_to_gold_drop_pp: -6.5\n      # Structural vs probe gap on gold\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_gold_pp: 5\n      structural_rf_minus_probe_gold_pp: 4\n      # TWV Probe on gold\n      twv_probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.83\n      twv_probe_gold_f1_stag: 0.77\n      twv_probe_gold_f1_prog: 0.89\n      # LLM-judge zero-shot on gold\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.68\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_stag: 0.62\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_prog: 0.74\n      # MV labels on gold (non-trivial — MV ≠ gold)\n      mv_gold_macro_f1: 0.92\n      mv_gold_f1_stag: 0.88\n      mv_gold_f1_prog: 0.96\n      # Gold-validated cross-agent gap estimate\n      indomain_gold_scaling_factor: 0.56\n      estimated_crossagent_gold_gap_pp: 20.6\n      # Disagreement breakdown\n      disagree_semantic_diverse_stag_n: 72\n      disagree_semantic_diverse_stag_pct: 79.1\n      disagree_cmdrep_fp_n: 19\n      disagree_cmdrep_fp_pct: 20.9\n      # Method accuracy on disagreement windows\n      structural_gb_correct_on_disagree_pct: 0.22\n      probe_correct_on_disagree_pct: 0.38\n      llm_judge_correct_on_disagree_pct: 0.52\n\n    result_rationale: |\n      Gold κ=0.78: 停滞判定在明显情况下（重复命令、完全停转）annotators 高度一致，但在 \"agent 执行多样化动作却无实质进展\" 的窗口上存在合理分歧——一个 annotator 可能看到多样动作判 progress，另一个看到无效果判 stagnation。κ=0.78 处于 substantial agreement 上端，足以支撑 gold set 作为评估基准但不高到 trivial。\n\n      Gold-MV agreement 86%: 650 窗口中 559 个 MV 标签与 gold 一致。14% 分歧（91 窗口）高度非对称——79% 是 MV=progress/gold=stagnation。这是因为 3 个 LF 都依赖结构信号（命令重复、文件变化、outcome）：当 agent 执行多样但无效的动作序列时，cmd_rep 不触发（动作不重复）、file_diff 不触发（文件确实在变化只是无用变化）、OB 可能也不触发——所有 LF 说 progress，但人类看到的是语义停滞。剩余 21% 分歧（19 窗口）是反向的：agent 重复命令但实际在迭代调试，cmd_rep 触发标为 stagnation 但人类判 progress。\n\n      Structural RF/GB gold 0.88/0.89: 从 LF-eval 0.9951 下降 ~10.5-11.5pp。结构特征本质上是 LF 输入的超集（30 维中包含 cmd_rep_ratio、file_diff_freq 等直接对应 LF 规则的特征），在 LF-derived labels 上几乎完美预测是 circular artifact。Gold 打破循环后，structural 模型在 72 个 MV=prog/gold=stag 窗口上大多预测 progress（因为这些窗口的结构特征与 LF 判定一致），导致系统性 FN。但 structural 仍维持 0.88+ 因为：(a) 14% 分歧窗口中仍有部分被其他非循环特征（如 output length decay、step timing patterns）正确分类；(b) 86% 一致窗口上 structural 几乎完美。GB 略优于 RF 因为 boosting 对边界样本学到了更细的决策面。\n\n      Probe gold 0.84: 从 LF-eval 0.9055 仅下降 6.5pp（vs structural 10.5pp）。probe 虽在 LF 噪声标签上训练，但 GRU 从 embeddings 中学到了部分语义信号——embedding 空间中 \"多样但无效\" 的窗口与 \"真正进步\" 的窗口有可分离的表示差异（embedding 编码了动作的语义内容和变化模式，不仅仅是结构信号）。probe 在 72 个语义多样停滞窗口上约 38% 正确预测 stagnation（vs structural 的 22%），因为 embedding 捕获了 \"内容重复但表面不同\" 的模式。Probe 更小的 gold 下降量支撑 \"robustness to label noise\" 叙事。\n\n      Structural-probe gap 5pp on gold: LF-eval 上 ~9pp 中约 4pp 是 circular inflation（structural 获益不公平），gold 消除这部分后 gap 缩至 5pp。这 5pp 是 structural 的真实优势——来自显式特征提取在小数据/零适配场景下的信息效率优势，而非循环评估膨胀。\n\n      LLM-judge zero-shot gold 0.68: 比 LF-eval (0.6625) 略高 +1.75pp。LLM 是独立评估器，不受 LF 循环影响。在 72 个语义多样停滞窗口上，LLM 约 52% 正确（优于 probe 和 structural），因为 LLM 能理解 \"动作多样但无进展\" 的语义。但 LLM 在其他窗口上仍有较高误判率（对长尾结构模式不稳定），整体提升有限。\n\n      Gold stag rate 31.8% vs MV 的 ~27%: gold 判定比 MV 多 ~4.8pp stagnation（因 72 个 MV-miss 的语义停滞），支撑 \"LFs systematically undercount semantic diverse stagnation\" 的发现。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Gold-MV Agreement Confusion Matrix\"\n        description: |\n          2×2 矩阵：行=Gold label，列=MV label。\n          |           | MV=Prog | MV=Stag |\n          |-----------|---------|---------|\n          | Gold=Prog |   424   |   19    |\n          | Gold=Stag |    72   |  135    |\n          Agreement=86%, Cohen's κ=0.68.\n          主要分歧：72 个 MV=Prog/Gold=Stag 窗口（语义多样停滞）。\n\n      - name: \"Table: Method Comparison — LF-Eval vs Gold-Eval\"\n        description: |\n          | Method          | LF-Eval F1 | Gold-Eval F1 | Δ (pp)  | Drop ratio |\n          |-----------------|-----------|-------------|---------|------------|\n          | Structural RF   | 0.9951    | 0.88        | -11.5   | 1.00x ref  |\n          | Structural GB   | 0.9951    | 0.89        | -10.5   | 0.91x      |\n          | GRU Probe       | 0.9055    | 0.84        | -6.5    | 0.57x      |\n          | TWV Probe       | 0.9485†   | 0.83        | -11.9   | 1.03x      |\n          | LLM-judge (0-s) | 0.6625    | 0.68        | +1.8    | —          |\n          | MV labels       | 1.000‡    | 0.92        | -8.0    | —          |\n          † dryrun proxy; ‡ tautological.\n          Probe 下降最小（0.57x of structural drop），支撑 label noise robustness claim。\n\n      - name: \"Table: Gold Disagreement Window Analysis\"\n        description: |\n          | Category                | N   | Pct  | Structural correct | Probe correct | LLM correct |\n          |-------------------------|-----|------|--------------------|---------------|-------------|\n          | MV=Prog, Gold=Stag      | 72  | 79%  | 22%                | 38%           | 52%         |\n          | MV=Stag, Gold=Prog      | 19  | 21%  | 37%                | 32%           | 42%         |\n          | Total disagreements     | 91  | 100% | 25%                | 37%           | 50%         |\n          语义多样停滞是主导分歧类型；LLM 在此子集上最准但整体 F1 仍最低。\n\n      - name: \"Table: Gold-Validated Claim Revision Summary\"\n        description: |\n          | Claim metric                    | LF-eval  | Gold-eval | Revision needed? |\n          |---------------------------------|----------|-----------|------------------|\n          | Structural in-domain F1         | 0.9951   | 0.89      | Yes: -10.5pp     |\n          | Probe in-domain F1              | 0.9055   | 0.84      | Yes: -6.5pp      |\n          | Struct-Probe gap (in-domain)    | +9.0pp   | +5.0pp    | Yes: advantage not dominance |\n          | Cross-agent gap (estimated)     | +36.9pp  | ~+20pp    | Yes: reframe     |\n          | LLM-judge gap vs structural     | +33.3pp  | +21pp     | Yes: narrower    |\n          | TLM negative finding            | holds    | holds     | No               |\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Grouped bar chart — macro_f1 of each method on LF-eval vs Gold-eval, 双色柱状图直观展示 circular inflation 的差异幅度。Structural 柱高差最大，probe 差最小。\"\n      - \"Fig: Gold-MV disagreement heatmap by LF firing pattern — 91 个分歧窗口按 3 个 LF 的触发状态（火/不火）分 8 格，展示 semantic diverse stagnation 集中在 (cmd_rep=0, file_diff=0) 或 (cmd_rep=0, file_diff=1, OB=0) 区域。\"\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plot — probe prediction probability vs gold label on 91 disagreement windows, 展示 probe 在 MV=prog/gold=stag 窗口上的概率分布（部分接近 0.5 threshold），支撑 'probe captures partial semantic signal' 的叙事。\"\n\n    analysis: |\n      GO/NO-GO 判定：GO（有条件）。\n\n      Gold κ=0.78 确认 stagnation 概念在人类判断上有足够一致性，task formulation 成立。86% gold-MV agreement 说明 LF pipeline 整体可靠但存在系统性盲区——语义多样停滞占分歧的 79%，这正是 structural features 无法检测的 failure mode（因为结构上看起来像 progress）。\n\n      核心影响：\n      1. Claim 1 措辞从 'dominance' 改为 'practical advantage'。Gold 上 structural GB 0.89 仍优于 probe 0.84（+5pp），但幅度大幅缩水。论文需强调这是 \"zero-data deployment advantage\"——当目标 agent 无标注数据时，structural 仍是最佳选择，但优势不再是压倒性的。\n      2. Circular evaluation 量化为 finding：structural 在 LF-eval 上的 0.9951 中有 ~10.5pp 是 circular inflation。这是 weak supervision 评估方法论的重要贡献——quantifies the ceiling of LF-derived evaluation。\n      3. Probe robustness narrative 加强：probe 在噪声标签训练后仍在 gold 上保持 0.84（仅 -6.5pp），且在语义多样停滞窗口上比 structural 更准（38% vs 22%）。这支撑 \"stagnation signals exist in embeddings but require adaptation to extract\" 的核心论点。\n      4. 新增 ~0.5 page subsection：Gold disagreement analysis 作为额外贡献，分析 LF 系统性误标模式。72 个 MV=prog/gold=stag 窗口的共同特征：(a) 命令多样性高（cmd_rep 不触发），(b) 文件变化频繁但无效（file_diff 不触发），(c) outcome 未解决但 OB 窗口内未回传。这为 weak supervision on sequential data 提供实证指导——结构性 LFs 天然遗漏语义级 failure modes。\n      5. TLM negative finding 不受影响——三种 TLM 在 gold 上的表现模式与 LF-eval 一致。\n      6. 论文整体评级：EMNLP Findings 水平。headline 数字更保守但增加了 gold-based error analysis 的方法论贡献，reviewer 对 circular evaluation concern 有了定量回应。\n\n  - name: llm-judge-fewshot\n    plan_id: llm-judge-fewshot\n    description: \"LLM-as-judge few-shot + CoT variant (Claude Sonnet, 5-shot with stagnation examples covering semantic diverse stagnation cases + chain-of-thought prompting), evaluated on 650 gold windows\"\n    expected_results:\n      llm_judge_fewshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.76\n      llm_judge_fewshot_gold_f1_stag: 0.71\n      llm_judge_fewshot_gold_f1_prog: 0.81\n      llm_judge_fewshot_gold_accuracy: 0.79\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.68\n      delta_fewshot_vs_zeroshot_pp: 8.0\n      structural_gb_gold_macro_f1: 0.89\n      structural_advantage_over_fewshot_pp: 13.0\n      probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.84\n      probe_advantage_over_fewshot_pp: 8.0\n      api_cost_usd_estimated: 14.5\n      inference_time_per_window_ms: 2800\n      total_tokens_estimated: 3800000\n      fewshot_correct_on_semantic_diverse_stag_pct: 0.61\n      fewshot_correct_on_agree_windows_pct: 0.82\n      parse_failures: 2\n      cot_avg_reasoning_tokens: 180\n\n    result_rationale: |\n      Few-shot + CoT 从 0.68 提升到 0.76（+8pp）有三层原因：\n\n      (1) 5 个示例覆盖关键 failure modes：选取的 few-shot 示例特意包含 2 个语义多样停滞窗口（agent 执行多样命令但无进展）+ 2 个明确停滞 + 1 个命令重复但实际进步的边界案例。这直接教会 LLM \"多样 ≠ 进步\" 的判断标准——zero-shot 时 LLM 倾向把多样化动作序列判为 progress。Few-shot 后在 72 个语义多样停滞窗口上正确率从 52%→61%。\n\n      (2) CoT 改善边界案例推理：chain-of-thought 迫使 LLM 显式评估 \"这些动作是否向目标推进\" 而非仅看动作多样性。但 CoT 也引入新的错误模式——过度推理导致在一些清晰窗口上 overthink（~3% 的明确 progress 窗口被 CoT 推理为 stagnation）。\n\n      (3) 天花板效应：LLM 处理 5 步窗口的文本时缺乏全 trajectory 上下文——无法判断当前窗口在整体求解过程中的位置。这限制了 few-shot 的提升空间。对比 structural（有显式 trajectory position 特征）和 probe（GRU 编码时序上下文），LLM 少了 position-aware 信号。\n\n      Structural 仍领先 +13pp（0.89 vs 0.76）：structural 的非循环特征（output length decay、step timing、error patterns）在清晰窗口上比 LLM 的文本推理更稳定。\n      Probe 领先 +8pp（0.84 vs 0.76）：probe 的 embedding 时序建模比 LLM 的 window-level 推理更高效。\n\n      成本论证不变：structural <5ms/window 且 $0 vs LLM $14.5 + 2800ms/window。即使 few-shot 缩小了 accuracy gap，cost-performance tradeoff 仍明确支持 structural/probe。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LLM-Judge Variants on Gold\"\n        description: |\n          | Variant          | Gold F1 | Δ vs Structural | Cost ($) | ms/window |\n          |------------------|---------|-----------------|----------|-----------|\n          | Zero-shot        | 0.68    | -21.0pp         | 11.66    | 2200      |\n          | 5-shot + CoT     | 0.76    | -13.0pp         | 14.50    | 2800      |\n          | Structural GB    | 0.89    | ref             | 0        | <5        |\n          | GRU Probe        | 0.84    | -5.0pp          | 0        | <10       |\n          Few-shot 缩小 gap 8pp 但 cost 增 24%，structural cost-performance 优势仍 overwhelming。\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Cost-accuracy Pareto frontier — x=inference cost per window, y=gold macro_f1. Structural 和 probe 在左上角（低成本高准确），LLM variants 在右下方。Few-shot 比 zero-shot 右移（更贵）且上移（更准）但仍远未达 Pareto frontier。\"\n\n    analysis: |\n      Few-shot 的 +8pp 提升可写入论文但不改变核心叙事。关键论点：\n      1. Structural 仍领先 +13pp on gold（$0 cost）——cost-performance argument 完整保留。\n      2. Few-shot 在语义多样停滞上最好（61% correct），但这个子集仅占 11% 窗口——LLM 在大量清晰窗口上仍不如 structural/probe 稳定。\n      3. 论文可增加一行 Table 对比 few-shot，但 few-shot 需要标注数据选 exemplars，这违背了 structural 的 zero-data 优势定位——fair comparison 应指出 few-shot 也需要目标域知识。\n      4. 对 reviewer \"why not LLM\" 的回应更强：即使 5-shot + CoT，structural 仍 +13pp at 零成本。\n\n  - name: structural-feature-overlap-ablation\n    plan_id: structural-feature-overlap-ablation\n    description: \"从 30 维 structural vector 中移除与 LF 规则直接重叠的特征（cmd_rep_ratio, unique_cmd_ratio, file_diff_freq, file_diff_delta 等 ~12 个 LF-overlapping 特征），保留 ~18 个非循环特征（output length stats, step timing, error frequency, edit size patterns），在 gold 650 窗口上评估 residual F1\"\n    expected_results:\n      full_30dim_gold_macro_f1: 0.89\n      residual_18dim_gold_macro_f1: 0.80\n      residual_18dim_gold_f1_stag: 0.74\n      residual_18dim_gold_f1_prog: 0.86\n      residual_18dim_gold_accuracy: 0.83\n      circular_contribution_pp: 9.0\n      noncircular_contribution_pp: null  # 0.80 vs random ~0.50 = 30pp above chance\n      residual_18dim_lf_eval_macro_f1: 0.92\n      residual_18dim_lf_to_gold_drop_pp: -12.0\n      full_30dim_lf_eval_macro_f1: 0.9951\n      removed_features_n: 12\n      retained_features_n: 18\n      top_residual_features_by_importance:\n        - output_length_decay_rate\n        - step_time_variance\n        - error_message_frequency\n        - edit_size_entropy\n        - unique_file_count_ratio\n      probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.84\n      residual_vs_probe_gap_pp: -4.0\n\n    result_rationale: |\n      移除 12 个 LF-overlapping 特征后 gold F1 从 0.89 降至 0.80（-9pp），解读分三层：\n\n      (1) Circular 贡献量化为 ~9pp：30 维中 12 个直接映射 LF 规则的特征（cmd_rep_ratio → cmd_rep LF，file_diff_freq → file_diff LF，etc.）贡献了 gold F1 中约 9pp。这些特征在 LF-eval 上贡献更大（0.9951 vs 0.92 = 7.5pp），但在 gold 上也有真实价值——因为 86% 的 gold 标签与 MV 一致，LF-aligned 特征在这些窗口上确实检测了真实 stagnation。\n\n      (2) 剩余 18 维特征产生 0.80 gold F1——显著高于随机（~0.50）。非循环信号包括：\n      - output_length_decay：停滞窗口中 LLM 输出越来越短（尝试减少），这是 LF 未编码的行为信号\n      - step_time_variance：停滞时步长时间更均匀（机械性重试），progress 时时间方差更大（深度思考 vs 快速动作）\n      - error_message_frequency：停滞窗口中错误信息更密集\n      - edit_size_entropy：停滞时编辑大小分布更集中（反复小改），progress 时更分散\n      但这些信号不够支撑 \"dominance\" claim——residual 0.80 实际上低于 probe 的 0.84。\n\n      (3) Residual < probe（0.80 vs 0.84，-4pp）：关键发现。去掉循环成分后，structural 的非循环信号不如 probe 的语义信号。这意味着 structural 的 gold 优势（0.89 vs 0.84 = +5pp）中约 9pp 来自 LF-aligned 特征——但因为 86% gold=MV，这些特征在 gold 上也有价值（不是纯 artifact）。Structural 的真实优势来自 \"包含 LF 规则作为特征\" 的工程优势 + 非循环补充信号，而非比 probe 更好地理解 stagnation。\n\n      LF-eval 上 residual 0.92（vs full 0.9951 = -7.5pp）：LF 标签上仍很高因为非循环特征（output length decay 等）与 LF 标签仍有较强相关——停滞窗口确实表现出这些模式。但 gold 上 residual 下降更大（-12pp from 0.92 to 0.80）因为非循环特征在语义多样停滞窗口上也失效——agent 多样化尝试时 output length 未必衰减、error 未必更频繁。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Structural Feature Overlap Ablation on Gold\"\n        description: |\n          | Feature set              | N_dim | LF-Eval F1 | Gold F1 | LF→Gold drop |\n          |--------------------------|-------|-----------|---------|-------------- |\n          | Full structural          | 30    | 0.9951    | 0.89    | -10.5pp      |\n          | Non-circular residual    | 18    | 0.92      | 0.80    | -12.0pp      |\n          | Circular contribution    | —     | +7.5pp    | +9.0pp  | —            |\n          | GRU Probe (reference)    | 1024  | 0.9055    | 0.84    | -6.5pp       |\n          Non-circular structural (0.80) < probe (0.84): structural 的 gold 优势部分依赖 LF-aligned 特征。\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Feature importance bar chart — 18 个 non-circular 特征在 gold evaluation 上的 permutation importance 排名。output_length_decay 和 step_time_variance 贡献最大，展示哪些非循环信号是 stagnation 的真实 indicator。\"\n      - \"Fig: Venn-style diagram — structural F1 的组成分解：circular component (0.09), non-circular component (0.30 above chance), overlap region. 对比 probe 的 0.34 above chance。\"\n\n    analysis: |\n      这个实验是 circular evaluation finding 的核心证据。关键叙事：\n      1. Structural 的 gold 优势（+5pp vs probe）中约 9pp 来自 LF-aligned 特征。这不是纯 artifact——86% gold 与 MV 一致意味着 LF-aligned 特征在大多数窗口上确实检测了真实 stagnation。但称之为 \"dominance\" 不合适。\n      2. 非循环 residual 0.80 < probe 0.84：structural 在去除循环成分后不如 probe。这支撑 \"probe captures genuine semantic signal\" 的叙事。\n      3. 论文呈现策略：Structural 的优势来自 (a) 包含 LF 规则作为显式特征的工程优势 + (b) 非循环补充信号。这在零数据部署场景下仍有明确实用价值——不需要训练，不需要 embedding 模型，不需要适配。\n      4. 这个 ablation 为 'Circular Evaluation as Finding' 小节提供定量支撑：LF-eval 上 structural 的 0.9951 中至少 7.5pp 是循环膨胀（gold 上是 9pp）。\n\n  - name: cross-agent-instance-isolation\n    plan_id: cross-agent-instance-isolation\n    description: \"重新评估 cross-agent structural GB，确保 SWE-bench instance 在 train/test 间完全隔离（同一 issue 的不同 agent run 不跨 split），排除 instance-level information leakage\"\n    expected_results:\n      original_gb_cross_agent_all: 0.9674\n      isolated_gb_cross_agent_all: 0.93\n      delta_pp: -3.7\n      isolated_gb_f1_stag: 0.89\n      isolated_gb_f1_prog: 0.97\n      isolated_gb_accuracy: 0.94\n      original_rf_cross_agent_all: 0.9123\n      isolated_rf_cross_agent_all: 0.88\n      isolated_rf_delta_pp: -3.2\n      n_shared_instances_removed: 47\n      n_test_windows_after_isolation: 142800\n      n_train_windows_after_isolation: 13200\n      leakage_effect_size_pp: 3.7\n      probe_zeroshot_for_reference: 0.5984\n      isolated_structural_advantage_over_probe_zeroshot_pp: 33.2\n      original_structural_advantage_over_probe_zeroshot_pp: 36.9\n\n    result_rationale: |\n      Instance isolation 导致 GB 从 0.967 降至 0.93（-3.7pp），存在微量但非 trivial 的 leakage 效应：\n\n      (1) Leakage 机制：SWE-bench 中同一 issue 可能被 SWE-Agent（训练集）和 OpenHands（测试集）同时尝试。虽然两个 agent 的行为模式完全不同，但同一 issue 可能有 issue-specific 的 structural signatures——比如某些 issue 天然导致更多文件操作或更长的调试循环。Structural features 中的某些维度（如 unique_file_count、error_frequency）可能携带 issue-level 信号。移除 ~47 个 shared instances 后，测试集失去了这些 train-side 可见 issue 的 structural context。\n\n      (2) 下降幅度 3.7pp 的分解：\n      - ~2pp 来自真实 leakage 消除——shared instances 上模型确实利用了 issue-level structural patterns\n      - ~1.7pp 来自 train set 缩小效应——移除 shared instances 减少了约 8% 训练数据，GB 对此有轻微敏感性\n\n      (3) 0.93 仍远优于 probe zero-shot 0.598（+33.2pp）：leakage 效应真实存在但不 invalidate structural 的 cross-agent transfer 优势。核心论点保持：structural features 在零样本跨 agent 迁移上大幅领先 probe，gap 从 +36.9pp 微调至 +33.2pp。\n\n      (4) RF 下降更温和（-3.2pp vs GB -3.7pp）：RF 的 bagging 天然更不依赖单个 instance 的信号，对 leakage removal 更鲁棒。但 RF 基线更低（0.9123→0.88），整体仍不如 GB。\n\n      (5) 为什么不会降得更多：structural features 本质上是 agent 行为模式的汇总统计量（cmd_rep_ratio、file_diff_freq 等），主要反映 agent 架构差异而非 issue 差异。SWE-Agent 和 OpenHands 在同一 issue 上的 structural pattern 可能完全不同——前者多用 shell 命令，后者更多文件编辑。Issue-level leakage 只通过少数 issue-invariant 的特征（如 issue 难度 → 总步数 → stagnation 概率）传导，影响有限。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Agent Structural GB — Instance Isolation Impact\"\n        description: |\n          | Setting                    | GB F1  | RF F1  | N_test   | Δ GB (pp) |\n          |----------------------------|--------|--------|----------|-----------|\n          | Original (shared OK)       | 0.9674 | 0.9123 | 150,652  | ref       |\n          | Instance-isolated          | 0.93   | 0.88   | 142,800  | -3.7      |\n          | Shared instances removed   | —      | —      | 47 inst  | —         |\n          |                            |        |        |          |           |\n          | Probe zero-shot (ref)      | 0.598  | —      | —        | —         |\n          | Isolated advantage vs probe| +33.2pp| +28.2pp| —        | —         |\n          Leakage effect 3.7pp: real but does not invalidate cross-agent advantage.\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Before/after bar chart — GB 和 RF 的 cross-agent F1 在 instance isolation 前后对比，附 probe zero-shot 基线参考线。清晰展示 leakage effect 虽存在但 structural advantage 仍然 overwhelming。\"\n\n    analysis: |\n      Instance isolation 实验的结论：存在微量 leakage（3.7pp）但不影响核心 claim。\n      1. 论文中需报告 isolated 数字（0.93）而非原始数字（0.967）作为 conservative estimate。\n      2. Cross-agent headline 从 \"+36.9pp advantage\" 改为 \"+33.2pp advantage (instance-isolated)\"。\n      3. Gold-estimated cross-agent gap 需同步调整：0.93 * gold_scaling ≈ 0.93 * (0.89/0.9951) ≈ 0.83 on gold equivalent。Probe zero-shot gold ≈ 0.58。Gold-estimated isolated gap ≈ 25pp。\n      4. Reviewer 对 leakage concern 的回应完整——量化为 3.7pp，远小于 structural-probe gap，方法论严谨。\n      5. 与 overlap ablation 结合叙事：structural 的 cross-agent 优势在 instance isolation（-3.7pp）和 overlap ablation（-9pp）双重修正后仍然显著，但 magnitude 需全面 recalibrate。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":38609,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":38609},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"addbcf85-0d89-4f52-92b9-37c2e3ee4ae8","uuid":"bdd03e7f-8c33-4800-8bd8-301072380574"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":342417,"duration_api_ms":344275,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: |\n  Gold 部分验证 MV 标签——86% 一致但在语义多样停滞上存在系统性分歧（FP 高置信区）。\n  Structural 仍优于 probe 但 gap 从 ~9pp 缩至 ~5pp on gold；'dominance' 降级为 'practical advantage in zero-data deployment'。\n  论文增加 ~0.5 page subsection 'Gold Annotation Reveals LF Label Noise Patterns'，将 MV-gold 分歧作为额外方法论贡献。\n  Circular evaluation 从 caveat 升级为 finding：structural 在 gold 上 -10.5pp vs LF-eval，量化循环膨胀。\n  Probe 叙事加强：gold 上仅 -6.5pp（vs structural -10.5pp），'semantic probe demonstrates robustness to label noise'。\n  Cross-agent headline 从 +36.9pp 调整为 gold-estimated ~+20pp（in-domain scaling factor 5/9 applied to cross-agent LF gap）。\n  整体仍是 solid EMNLP Findings paper；headline 数字更保守但方法论贡献增厚。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: gold-set\n    plan_id: gold-set\n    description: \"650 windows human gold annotation evaluation — all methods re-evaluated against gold labels; gold-MV disagreement analysis; inter-annotator agreement; GO/NO-GO gate for paper claims\"\n    expected_results:\n      # Annotation quality\n      gold_n: 650\n      gold_stag_count: 207\n      gold_prog_count: 443\n      gold_stag_rate: 0.318\n      gold_kappa: 0.78\n      # Gold-MV agreement\n      gold_mv_agreement_rate: 0.86\n      gold_mv_agreement_n: 559\n      gold_mv_disagreement_n: 91\n      mv_prog_gold_stag: 72\n      mv_stag_gold_prog: 19\n      cohen_kappa_gold_mv: 0.68\n      # Structural RF on gold\n      structural_rf_gold_macro_f1: 0.88\n      structural_rf_gold_f1_stag: 0.83\n      structural_rf_gold_f1_prog: 0.93\n      structural_rf_gold_accuracy: 0.90\n      structural_rf_lf_to_gold_drop_pp: -11.5\n      # Structural GB on gold\n      structural_gb_gold_macro_f1: 0.89\n      structural_gb_gold_f1_stag: 0.84\n      structural_gb_gold_f1_prog: 0.94\n      structural_gb_gold_accuracy: 0.91\n      structural_gb_lf_to_gold_drop_pp: -10.5\n      # GRU Probe (Qwen3) on gold\n      probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.84\n      probe_gold_f1_stag: 0.78\n      probe_gold_f1_prog: 0.90\n      probe_gold_accuracy: 0.87\n      probe_lf_to_gold_drop_pp: -6.5\n      # Structural vs probe gap on gold\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_gold_pp: 5\n      structural_rf_minus_probe_gold_pp: 4\n      # TWV Probe on gold\n      twv_probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.83\n      twv_probe_gold_f1_stag: 0.77\n      twv_probe_gold_f1_prog: 0.89\n      # LLM-judge zero-shot on gold\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.68\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_stag: 0.62\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_prog: 0.74\n      # MV labels on gold (non-trivial — MV ≠ gold)\n      mv_gold_macro_f1: 0.92\n      mv_gold_f1_stag: 0.88\n      mv_gold_f1_prog: 0.96\n      # Gold-validated cross-agent gap estimate\n      indomain_gold_scaling_factor: 0.56\n      estimated_crossagent_gold_gap_pp: 20.6\n      # Disagreement breakdown\n      disagree_semantic_diverse_stag_n: 72\n      disagree_semantic_diverse_stag_pct: 79.1\n      disagree_cmdrep_fp_n: 19\n      disagree_cmdrep_fp_pct: 20.9\n      # Method accuracy on disagreement windows\n      structural_gb_correct_on_disagree_pct: 0.22\n      probe_correct_on_disagree_pct: 0.38\n      llm_judge_correct_on_disagree_pct: 0.52\n\n    result_rationale: |\n      Gold κ=0.78: 停滞判定在明显情况下（重复命令、完全停转）annotators 高度一致，但在 \"agent 执行多样化动作却无实质进展\" 的窗口上存在合理分歧——一个 annotator 可能看到多样动作判 progress，另一个看到无效果判 stagnation。κ=0.78 处于 substantial agreement 上端，足以支撑 gold set 作为评估基准但不高到 trivial。\n\n      Gold-MV agreement 86%: 650 窗口中 559 个 MV 标签与 gold 一致。14% 分歧（91 窗口）高度非对称——79% 是 MV=progress/gold=stagnation。这是因为 3 个 LF 都依赖结构信号（命令重复、文件变化、outcome）：当 agent 执行多样但无效的动作序列时，cmd_rep 不触发（动作不重复）、file_diff 不触发（文件确实在变化只是无用变化）、OB 可能也不触发——所有 LF 说 progress，但人类看到的是语义停滞。剩余 21% 分歧（19 窗口）是反向的：agent 重复命令但实际在迭代调试，cmd_rep 触发标为 stagnation 但人类判 progress。\n\n      Structural RF/GB gold 0.88/0.89: 从 LF-eval 0.9951 下降 ~10.5-11.5pp。结构特征本质上是 LF 输入的超集（30 维中包含 cmd_rep_ratio、file_diff_freq 等直接对应 LF 规则的特征），在 LF-derived labels 上几乎完美预测是 circular artifact。Gold 打破循环后，structural 模型在 72 个 MV=prog/gold=stag 窗口上大多预测 progress（因为这些窗口的结构特征与 LF 判定一致），导致系统性 FN。但 structural 仍维持 0.88+ 因为：(a) 14% 分歧窗口中仍有部分被其他非循环特征（如 output length decay、step timing patterns）正确分类；(b) 86% 一致窗口上 structural 几乎完美。GB 略优于 RF 因为 boosting 对边界样本学到了更细的决策面。\n\n      Probe gold 0.84: 从 LF-eval 0.9055 仅下降 6.5pp（vs structural 10.5pp）。probe 虽在 LF 噪声标签上训练，但 GRU 从 embeddings 中学到了部分语义信号——embedding 空间中 \"多样但无效\" 的窗口与 \"真正进步\" 的窗口有可分离的表示差异（embedding 编码了动作的语义内容和变化模式，不仅仅是结构信号）。probe 在 72 个语义多样停滞窗口上约 38% 正确预测 stagnation（vs structural 的 22%），因为 embedding 捕获了 \"内容重复但表面不同\" 的模式。Probe 更小的 gold 下降量支撑 \"robustness to label noise\" 叙事。\n\n      Structural-probe gap 5pp on gold: LF-eval 上 ~9pp 中约 4pp 是 circular inflation（structural 获益不公平），gold 消除这部分后 gap 缩至 5pp。这 5pp 是 structural 的真实优势——来自显式特征提取在小数据/零适配场景下的信息效率优势，而非循环评估膨胀。\n\n      LLM-judge zero-shot gold 0.68: 比 LF-eval (0.6625) 略高 +1.75pp。LLM 是独立评估器，不受 LF 循环影响。在 72 个语义多样停滞窗口上，LLM 约 52% 正确（优于 probe 和 structural），因为 LLM 能理解 \"动作多样但无进展\" 的语义。但 LLM 在其他窗口上仍有较高误判率（对长尾结构模式不稳定），整体提升有限。\n\n      Gold stag rate 31.8% vs MV 的 ~27%: gold 判定比 MV 多 ~4.8pp stagnation（因 72 个 MV-miss 的语义停滞），支撑 \"LFs systematically undercount semantic diverse stagnation\" 的发现。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Gold-MV Agreement Confusion Matrix\"\n        description: |\n          2×2 矩阵：行=Gold label，列=MV label。\n          |           | MV=Prog | MV=Stag |\n          |-----------|---------|---------|\n          | Gold=Prog |   424   |   19    |\n          | Gold=Stag |    72   |  135    |\n          Agreement=86%, Cohen's κ=0.68.\n          主要分歧：72 个 MV=Prog/Gold=Stag 窗口（语义多样停滞）。\n\n      - name: \"Table: Method Comparison — LF-Eval vs Gold-Eval\"\n        description: |\n          | Method          | LF-Eval F1 | Gold-Eval F1 | Δ (pp)  | Drop ratio |\n          |-----------------|-----------|-------------|---------|------------|\n          | Structural RF   | 0.9951    | 0.88        | -11.5   | 1.00x ref  |\n          | Structural GB   | 0.9951    | 0.89        | -10.5   | 0.91x      |\n          | GRU Probe       | 0.9055    | 0.84        | -6.5    | 0.57x      |\n          | TWV Probe       | 0.9485†   | 0.83        | -11.9   | 1.03x      |\n          | LLM-judge (0-s) | 0.6625    | 0.68        | +1.8    | —          |\n          | MV labels       | 1.000‡    | 0.92        | -8.0    | —          |\n          † dryrun proxy; ‡ tautological.\n          Probe 下降最小（0.57x of structural drop），支撑 label noise robustness claim。\n\n      - name: \"Table: Gold Disagreement Window Analysis\"\n        description: |\n          | Category                | N   | Pct  | Structural correct | Probe correct | LLM correct |\n          |-------------------------|-----|------|--------------------|---------------|-------------|\n          | MV=Prog, Gold=Stag      | 72  | 79%  | 22%                | 38%           | 52%         |\n          | MV=Stag, Gold=Prog      | 19  | 21%  | 37%                | 32%           | 42%         |\n          | Total disagreements     | 91  | 100% | 25%                | 37%           | 50%         |\n          语义多样停滞是主导分歧类型；LLM 在此子集上最准但整体 F1 仍最低。\n\n      - name: \"Table: Gold-Validated Claim Revision Summary\"\n        description: |\n          | Claim metric                    | LF-eval  | Gold-eval | Revision needed? |\n          |---------------------------------|----------|-----------|------------------|\n          | Structural in-domain F1         | 0.9951   | 0.89      | Yes: -10.5pp     |\n          | Probe in-domain F1              | 0.9055   | 0.84      | Yes: -6.5pp      |\n          | Struct-Probe gap (in-domain)    | +9.0pp   | +5.0pp    | Yes: advantage not dominance |\n          | Cross-agent gap (estimated)     | +36.9pp  | ~+20pp    | Yes: reframe     |\n          | LLM-judge gap vs structural     | +33.3pp  | +21pp     | Yes: narrower    |\n          | TLM negative finding            | holds    | holds     | No               |\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Grouped bar chart — macro_f1 of each method on LF-eval vs Gold-eval, 双色柱状图直观展示 circular inflation 的差异幅度。Structural 柱高差最大，probe 差最小。\"\n      - \"Fig: Gold-MV disagreement heatmap by LF firing pattern — 91 个分歧窗口按 3 个 LF 的触发状态（火/不火）分 8 格，展示 semantic diverse stagnation 集中在 (cmd_rep=0, file_diff=0) 或 (cmd_rep=0, file_diff=1, OB=0) 区域。\"\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plot — probe prediction probability vs gold label on 91 disagreement windows, 展示 probe 在 MV=prog/gold=stag 窗口上的概率分布（部分接近 0.5 threshold），支撑 'probe captures partial semantic signal' 的叙事。\"\n\n    analysis: |\n      GO/NO-GO 判定：GO（有条件）。\n\n      Gold κ=0.78 确认 stagnation 概念在人类判断上有足够一致性，task formulation 成立。86% gold-MV agreement 说明 LF pipeline 整体可靠但存在系统性盲区——语义多样停滞占分歧的 79%，这正是 structural features 无法检测的 failure mode（因为结构上看起来像 progress）。\n\n      核心影响：\n      1. Claim 1 措辞从 'dominance' 改为 'practical advantage'。Gold 上 structural GB 0.89 仍优于 probe 0.84（+5pp），但幅度大幅缩水。论文需强调这是 \"zero-data deployment advantage\"——当目标 agent 无标注数据时，structural 仍是最佳选择，但优势不再是压倒性的。\n      2. Circular evaluation 量化为 finding：structural 在 LF-eval 上的 0.9951 中有 ~10.5pp 是 circular inflation。这是 weak supervision 评估方法论的重要贡献——quantifies the ceiling of LF-derived evaluation。\n      3. Probe robustness narrative 加强：probe 在噪声标签训练后仍在 gold 上保持 0.84（仅 -6.5pp），且在语义多样停滞窗口上比 structural 更准（38% vs 22%）。这支撑 \"stagnation signals exist in embeddings but require adaptation to extract\" 的核心论点。\n      4. 新增 ~0.5 page subsection：Gold disagreement analysis 作为额外贡献，分析 LF 系统性误标模式。72 个 MV=prog/gold=stag 窗口的共同特征：(a) 命令多样性高（cmd_rep 不触发），(b) 文件变化频繁但无效（file_diff 不触发），(c) outcome 未解决但 OB 窗口内未回传。这为 weak supervision on sequential data 提供实证指导——结构性 LFs 天然遗漏语义级 failure modes。\n      5. TLM negative finding 不受影响——三种 TLM 在 gold 上的表现模式与 LF-eval 一致。\n      6. 论文整体评级：EMNLP Findings 水平。headline 数字更保守但增加了 gold-based error analysis 的方法论贡献，reviewer 对 circular evaluation concern 有了定量回应。\n\n  - name: llm-judge-fewshot\n    plan_id: llm-judge-fewshot\n    description: \"LLM-as-judge few-shot + CoT variant (Claude Sonnet, 5-shot with stagnation examples covering semantic diverse stagnation cases + chain-of-thought prompting), evaluated on 650 gold windows\"\n    expected_results:\n      llm_judge_fewshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.76\n      llm_judge_fewshot_gold_f1_stag: 0.71\n      llm_judge_fewshot_gold_f1_prog: 0.81\n      llm_judge_fewshot_gold_accuracy: 0.79\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.68\n      delta_fewshot_vs_zeroshot_pp: 8.0\n      structural_gb_gold_macro_f1: 0.89\n      structural_advantage_over_fewshot_pp: 13.0\n      probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.84\n      probe_advantage_over_fewshot_pp: 8.0\n      api_cost_usd_estimated: 14.5\n      inference_time_per_window_ms: 2800\n      total_tokens_estimated: 3800000\n      fewshot_correct_on_semantic_diverse_stag_pct: 0.61\n      fewshot_correct_on_agree_windows_pct: 0.82\n      parse_failures: 2\n      cot_avg_reasoning_tokens: 180\n\n    result_rationale: |\n      Few-shot + CoT 从 0.68 提升到 0.76（+8pp）有三层原因：\n\n      (1) 5 个示例覆盖关键 failure modes：选取的 few-shot 示例特意包含 2 个语义多样停滞窗口（agent 执行多样命令但无进展）+ 2 个明确停滞 + 1 个命令重复但实际进步的边界案例。这直接教会 LLM \"多样 ≠ 进步\" 的判断标准——zero-shot 时 LLM 倾向把多样化动作序列判为 progress。Few-shot 后在 72 个语义多样停滞窗口上正确率从 52%→61%。\n\n      (2) CoT 改善边界案例推理：chain-of-thought 迫使 LLM 显式评估 \"这些动作是否向目标推进\" 而非仅看动作多样性。但 CoT 也引入新的错误模式——过度推理导致在一些清晰窗口上 overthink（~3% 的明确 progress 窗口被 CoT 推理为 stagnation）。\n\n      (3) 天花板效应：LLM 处理 5 步窗口的文本时缺乏全 trajectory 上下文——无法判断当前窗口在整体求解过程中的位置。这限制了 few-shot 的提升空间。对比 structural（有显式 trajectory position 特征）和 probe（GRU 编码时序上下文），LLM 少了 position-aware 信号。\n\n      Structural 仍领先 +13pp（0.89 vs 0.76）：structural 的非循环特征（output length decay、step timing、error patterns）在清晰窗口上比 LLM 的文本推理更稳定。\n      Probe 领先 +8pp（0.84 vs 0.76）：probe 的 embedding 时序建模比 LLM 的 window-level 推理更高效。\n\n      成本论证不变：structural <5ms/window 且 $0 vs LLM $14.5 + 2800ms/window。即使 few-shot 缩小了 accuracy gap，cost-performance tradeoff 仍明确支持 structural/probe。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LLM-Judge Variants on Gold\"\n        description: |\n          | Variant          | Gold F1 | Δ vs Structural | Cost ($) | ms/window |\n          |------------------|---------|-----------------|----------|-----------|\n          | Zero-shot        | 0.68    | -21.0pp         | 11.66    | 2200      |\n          | 5-shot + CoT     | 0.76    | -13.0pp         | 14.50    | 2800      |\n          | Structural GB    | 0.89    | ref             | 0        | <5        |\n          | GRU Probe        | 0.84    | -5.0pp          | 0        | <10       |\n          Few-shot 缩小 gap 8pp 但 cost 增 24%，structural cost-performance 优势仍 overwhelming。\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Cost-accuracy Pareto frontier — x=inference cost per window, y=gold macro_f1. Structural 和 probe 在左上角（低成本高准确），LLM variants 在右下方。Few-shot 比 zero-shot 右移（更贵）且上移（更准）但仍远未达 Pareto frontier。\"\n\n    analysis: |\n      Few-shot 的 +8pp 提升可写入论文但不改变核心叙事。关键论点：\n      1. Structural 仍领先 +13pp on gold（$0 cost）——cost-performance argument 完整保留。\n      2. Few-shot 在语义多样停滞上最好（61% correct），但这个子集仅占 11% 窗口——LLM 在大量清晰窗口上仍不如 structural/probe 稳定。\n      3. 论文可增加一行 Table 对比 few-shot，但 few-shot 需要标注数据选 exemplars，这违背了 structural 的 zero-data 优势定位——fair comparison 应指出 few-shot 也需要目标域知识。\n      4. 对 reviewer \"why not LLM\" 的回应更强：即使 5-shot + CoT，structural 仍 +13pp at 零成本。\n\n  - name: structural-feature-overlap-ablation\n    plan_id: structural-feature-overlap-ablation\n    description: \"从 30 维 structural vector 中移除与 LF 规则直接重叠的特征（cmd_rep_ratio, unique_cmd_ratio, file_diff_freq, file_diff_delta 等 ~12 个 LF-overlapping 特征），保留 ~18 个非循环特征（output length stats, step timing, error frequency, edit size patterns），在 gold 650 窗口上评估 residual F1\"\n    expected_results:\n      full_30dim_gold_macro_f1: 0.89\n      residual_18dim_gold_macro_f1: 0.80\n      residual_18dim_gold_f1_stag: 0.74\n      residual_18dim_gold_f1_prog: 0.86\n      residual_18dim_gold_accuracy: 0.83\n      circular_contribution_pp: 9.0\n      noncircular_contribution_pp: null  # 0.80 vs random ~0.50 = 30pp above chance\n      residual_18dim_lf_eval_macro_f1: 0.92\n      residual_18dim_lf_to_gold_drop_pp: -12.0\n      full_30dim_lf_eval_macro_f1: 0.9951\n      removed_features_n: 12\n      retained_features_n: 18\n      top_residual_features_by_importance:\n        - output_length_decay_rate\n        - step_time_variance\n        - error_message_frequency\n        - edit_size_entropy\n        - unique_file_count_ratio\n      probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.84\n      residual_vs_probe_gap_pp: -4.0\n\n    result_rationale: |\n      移除 12 个 LF-overlapping 特征后 gold F1 从 0.89 降至 0.80（-9pp），解读分三层：\n\n      (1) Circular 贡献量化为 ~9pp：30 维中 12 个直接映射 LF 规则的特征（cmd_rep_ratio → cmd_rep LF，file_diff_freq → file_diff LF，etc.）贡献了 gold F1 中约 9pp。这些特征在 LF-eval 上贡献更大（0.9951 vs 0.92 = 7.5pp），但在 gold 上也有真实价值——因为 86% 的 gold 标签与 MV 一致，LF-aligned 特征在这些窗口上确实检测了真实 stagnation。\n\n      (2) 剩余 18 维特征产生 0.80 gold F1——显著高于随机（~0.50）。非循环信号包括：\n      - output_length_decay：停滞窗口中 LLM 输出越来越短（尝试减少），这是 LF 未编码的行为信号\n      - step_time_variance：停滞时步长时间更均匀（机械性重试），progress 时时间方差更大（深度思考 vs 快速动作）\n      - error_message_frequency：停滞窗口中错误信息更密集\n      - edit_size_entropy：停滞时编辑大小分布更集中（反复小改），progress 时更分散\n      但这些信号不够支撑 \"dominance\" claim——residual 0.80 实际上低于 probe 的 0.84。\n\n      (3) Residual < probe（0.80 vs 0.84，-4pp）：关键发现。去掉循环成分后，structural 的非循环信号不如 probe 的语义信号。这意味着 structural 的 gold 优势（0.89 vs 0.84 = +5pp）中约 9pp 来自 LF-aligned 特征——但因为 86% gold=MV，这些特征在 gold 上也有价值（不是纯 artifact）。Structural 的真实优势来自 \"包含 LF 规则作为特征\" 的工程优势 + 非循环补充信号，而非比 probe 更好地理解 stagnation。\n\n      LF-eval 上 residual 0.92（vs full 0.9951 = -7.5pp）：LF 标签上仍很高因为非循环特征（output length decay 等）与 LF 标签仍有较强相关——停滞窗口确实表现出这些模式。但 gold 上 residual 下降更大（-12pp from 0.92 to 0.80）因为非循环特征在语义多样停滞窗口上也失效——agent 多样化尝试时 output length 未必衰减、error 未必更频繁。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Structural Feature Overlap Ablation on Gold\"\n        description: |\n          | Feature set              | N_dim | LF-Eval F1 | Gold F1 | LF→Gold drop |\n          |--------------------------|-------|-----------|---------|-------------- |\n          | Full structural          | 30    | 0.9951    | 0.89    | -10.5pp      |\n          | Non-circular residual    | 18    | 0.92      | 0.80    | -12.0pp      |\n          | Circular contribution    | —     | +7.5pp    | +9.0pp  | —            |\n          | GRU Probe (reference)    | 1024  | 0.9055    | 0.84    | -6.5pp       |\n          Non-circular structural (0.80) < probe (0.84): structural 的 gold 优势部分依赖 LF-aligned 特征。\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Feature importance bar chart — 18 个 non-circular 特征在 gold evaluation 上的 permutation importance 排名。output_length_decay 和 step_time_variance 贡献最大，展示哪些非循环信号是 stagnation 的真实 indicator。\"\n      - \"Fig: Venn-style diagram — structural F1 的组成分解：circular component (0.09), non-circular component (0.30 above chance), overlap region. 对比 probe 的 0.34 above chance。\"\n\n    analysis: |\n      这个实验是 circular evaluation finding 的核心证据。关键叙事：\n      1. Structural 的 gold 优势（+5pp vs probe）中约 9pp 来自 LF-aligned 特征。这不是纯 artifact——86% gold 与 MV 一致意味着 LF-aligned 特征在大多数窗口上确实检测了真实 stagnation。但称之为 \"dominance\" 不合适。\n      2. 非循环 residual 0.80 < probe 0.84：structural 在去除循环成分后不如 probe。这支撑 \"probe captures genuine semantic signal\" 的叙事。\n      3. 论文呈现策略：Structural 的优势来自 (a) 包含 LF 规则作为显式特征的工程优势 + (b) 非循环补充信号。这在零数据部署场景下仍有明确实用价值——不需要训练，不需要 embedding 模型，不需要适配。\n      4. 这个 ablation 为 'Circular Evaluation as Finding' 小节提供定量支撑：LF-eval 上 structural 的 0.9951 中至少 7.5pp 是循环膨胀（gold 上是 9pp）。\n\n  - name: cross-agent-instance-isolation\n    plan_id: cross-agent-instance-isolation\n    description: \"重新评估 cross-agent structural GB，确保 SWE-bench instance 在 train/test 间完全隔离（同一 issue 的不同 agent run 不跨 split），排除 instance-level information leakage\"\n    expected_results:\n      original_gb_cross_agent_all: 0.9674\n      isolated_gb_cross_agent_all: 0.93\n      delta_pp: -3.7\n      isolated_gb_f1_stag: 0.89\n      isolated_gb_f1_prog: 0.97\n      isolated_gb_accuracy: 0.94\n      original_rf_cross_agent_all: 0.9123\n      isolated_rf_cross_agent_all: 0.88\n      isolated_rf_delta_pp: -3.2\n      n_shared_instances_removed: 47\n      n_test_windows_after_isolation: 142800\n      n_train_windows_after_isolation: 13200\n      leakage_effect_size_pp: 3.7\n      probe_zeroshot_for_reference: 0.5984\n      isolated_structural_advantage_over_probe_zeroshot_pp: 33.2\n      original_structural_advantage_over_probe_zeroshot_pp: 36.9\n\n    result_rationale: |\n      Instance isolation 导致 GB 从 0.967 降至 0.93（-3.7pp），存在微量但非 trivial 的 leakage 效应：\n\n      (1) Leakage 机制：SWE-bench 中同一 issue 可能被 SWE-Agent（训练集）和 OpenHands（测试集）同时尝试。虽然两个 agent 的行为模式完全不同，但同一 issue 可能有 issue-specific 的 structural signatures——比如某些 issue 天然导致更多文件操作或更长的调试循环。Structural features 中的某些维度（如 unique_file_count、error_frequency）可能携带 issue-level 信号。移除 ~47 个 shared instances 后，测试集失去了这些 train-side 可见 issue 的 structural context。\n\n      (2) 下降幅度 3.7pp 的分解：\n      - ~2pp 来自真实 leakage 消除——shared instances 上模型确实利用了 issue-level structural patterns\n      - ~1.7pp 来自 train set 缩小效应——移除 shared instances 减少了约 8% 训练数据，GB 对此有轻微敏感性\n\n      (3) 0.93 仍远优于 probe zero-shot 0.598（+33.2pp）：leakage 效应真实存在但不 invalidate structural 的 cross-agent transfer 优势。核心论点保持：structural features 在零样本跨 agent 迁移上大幅领先 probe，gap 从 +36.9pp 微调至 +33.2pp。\n\n      (4) RF 下降更温和（-3.2pp vs GB -3.7pp）：RF 的 bagging 天然更不依赖单个 instance 的信号，对 leakage removal 更鲁棒。但 RF 基线更低（0.9123→0.88），整体仍不如 GB。\n\n      (5) 为什么不会降得更多：structural features 本质上是 agent 行为模式的汇总统计量（cmd_rep_ratio、file_diff_freq 等），主要反映 agent 架构差异而非 issue 差异。SWE-Agent 和 OpenHands 在同一 issue 上的 structural pattern 可能完全不同——前者多用 shell 命令，后者更多文件编辑。Issue-level leakage 只通过少数 issue-invariant 的特征（如 issue 难度 → 总步数 → stagnation 概率）传导，影响有限。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Agent Structural GB — Instance Isolation Impact\"\n        description: |\n          | Setting                    | GB F1  | RF F1  | N_test   | Δ GB (pp) |\n          |----------------------------|--------|--------|----------|-----------|\n          | Original (shared OK)       | 0.9674 | 0.9123 | 150,652  | ref       |\n          | Instance-isolated          | 0.93   | 0.88   | 142,800  | -3.7      |\n          | Shared instances removed   | —      | —      | 47 inst  | —         |\n          |                            |        |        |          |           |\n          | Probe zero-shot (ref)      | 0.598  | —      | —        | —         |\n          | Isolated advantage vs probe| +33.2pp| +28.2pp| —        | —         |\n          Leakage effect 3.7pp: real but does not invalidate cross-agent advantage.\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Before/after bar chart — GB 和 RF 的 cross-agent F1 在 instance isolation 前后对比，附 probe zero-shot 基线参考线。清晰展示 leakage effect 虽存在但 structural advantage 仍然 overwhelming。\"\n\n    analysis: |\n      Instance isolation 实验的结论：存在微量 leakage（3.7pp）但不影响核心 claim。\n      1. 论文中需报告 isolated 数字（0.93）而非原始数字（0.967）作为 conservative estimate。\n      2. Cross-agent headline 从 \"+36.9pp advantage\" 改为 \"+33.2pp advantage (instance-isolated)\"。\n      3. Gold-estimated cross-agent gap 需同步调整：0.93 * gold_scaling ≈ 0.93 * (0.89/0.9951) ≈ 0.83 on gold equivalent。Probe zero-shot gold ≈ 0.58。Gold-estimated isolated gap ≈ 25pp。\n      4. Reviewer 对 leakage concern 的回应完整——量化为 3.7pp，远小于 structural-probe gap，方法论严谨。\n      5. 与 overlap ablation 结合叙事：structural 的 cross-agent 优势在 instance isolation（-3.7pp）和 overlap ablation（-9pp）双重修正后仍然显著，但 magnitude 需全面 recalibrate。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"addbcf85-0d89-4f52-92b9-37c2e3ee4ae8","total_cost_usd":0.6801897499999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":38609,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":15971,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":38609,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":15971,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":38609,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":38609},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":33578,"outputTokens":20,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.033678,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":15971,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":38609,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6465117499999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"1fec1142-4c87-4ec3-8777-5c6bf0a4fa22"}
